url: "https://github.com/antonrosso34-maker/behavioral-report-cards/tree/main/gemma4-edit-construction-gap"
abstract: "A frozen 20-task audit of 4-bit Gemma 4 E2B repository patching, with retrieval/repair, oracle-file, and Qwen scale/QLoRA controls. The 2.3B floor is zero test-verified semantic passes; a 14B Qwen oracle closes one edit (seaborn-3010) but fails 19/20."
